Deploy App Skill
================

Created: 2026-01-31
Type: Databricks app deployment automation
Project: Genie Lamp Agent

This skill provides:
- Automated Databricks app deployment using Asset Bundles
- Support for both initial deployment (first-time) and update deployment
- Automatic handling of bundle deploy, app start, and app deploy commands
- Environment-specific deployments (dev, prod)
- Working directory support for projects with nested bundle configs

Project Configuration:
- Bundle Name: genie-lamp-agent
- App Resource Name: genie_lamp_app
- Working Directory: app/
- Available Environments: dev (default), prod
- Required Secrets Scope: genie-lamp
- Required Secret Keys: service-token, sql-warehouse-http-path

To use: Ask Claude to "deploy the app" or "deploy genie-lamp-agent to dev/prod"

The skill will automatically trigger when you request app deployment.

Deployment Types:
- Initial: First-time deployment (includes databricks apps start)
- Update: Update existing app (skips app start, only updates code)

Prerequisites:
- Databricks CLI installed and configured
- Secrets configured in genie-lamp scope
- Frontend built (if deploying after frontend changes)
